[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11341.11, "timestamp": "03:09:01", "text": "薪水"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11344.469, "timestamp": "03:09:04", "text": "这边。所以这就像是，又不像那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11346.389, "timestamp": "03:09:06", "text": "包括我的账单等等。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11348.309, "timestamp": "03:09:08", "text": "如果我把钱给别人，我就没钱付账单了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11351.75, "timestamp": "03:09:11", "text": "所以，这就是你在玩的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11355.67, "timestamp": "03:09:15", "text": "那里数额巨大。是的。我知道我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.03, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "拿不到黄金。就像我不这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11361.11, "timestamp": "03:09:21", "text": "知道它就像2000一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11364.389, "timestamp": "03:09:24", "text": "一切。它真的值2000吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11366.79, "timestamp": "03:09:26", "text": "据我了解，这非常好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11370.87, "timestamp": "03:09:30", "text": "等等，但是2000年，哦，就像……我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11375.83, "timestamp": "03:09:35", "text": "保留了 2000 作为头部呃装备是呃等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11380.469, "timestamp": "03:09:40", "text": "让我打个字，这套设备是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11384.55, "timestamp": "03:09:44", "text": "嗯，对，嗯，这个，嗯，等一下，让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11393.51, "timestamp": "03:09:53", "text": "我的天哪，那背带你才花了2000块钱！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11396.95, "timestamp": "03:09:56", "text": "在。好的。不，不，不，不，不。艺术"}]